# 22. World AI Workflow

Recommended workflow for World AI (extends Band 6 §23):

```text
Task assigned (world/locations/ecology)
  ↓
Read Band 7 + Band 4 + lore anchor
  ↓
Check Docs/World/ for existing regions/factions
  ↓
Verify consistency (§14 checklist)
  ↓
Propose minimal world content OR update Docs/World/
  ↓
Flag open questions if blocked
  ↓
Do not modify Source/ or gameplay code without scope
```

World AI **writes** to `Docs/World/` and Band 4 updates. World AI **reads** technical and gameplay bands; it does not change combat or engine architecture.

